╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│  Keys                                                                                                                       │
│                                                                                                                             │
│  Browse                                                                  Find                                               │
│    j / k           cursor down / up a row                                  ctrl-f          open find                        │
│    ctrl-d          half page down                                          enter / ↓       next match                       │
│    ctrl-u          half page up                                            ↑               previous match                   │
│    g / G           top / bottom                                            tab             switch find ↔ replace            │
│    tab             fold / unfold heading or bullet                         enter           replace (replace field)          │
│    z               fold page: bullets → headings → all                     ctrl-a          replace all (replace field)      │
│                                                                            esc             close find                       │
│  Links                                                                                                                      │
│    n / N           next / previous link or tag                           Vim mode                                           │
│    enter           follow link ([[Page#Heading]] opens at the heading)     editor = "vim"  in ~/.config/weft/config.toml    │
│                                                                            i a o / esc     insert / back to normal          │
│  History                                                                   v / V           visual / visual line             │
│    [               back                                                    d c y > <       operators; dd cc yy for lines    │
│    ]               forward                                                 u / ctrl-r      undo / redo                      │
│                                                                            .               repeat the last change           │
│  Open                                                                      / ? n N         search, next, previous           │
│    .               today's journal (new: from Journal Template)            :w :q :wq :q!   save / leave / both / discard    │
│    <               previous journal                                        ZZ / ZQ         save and leave / discard         │
│    >               next journal                                            :preview        live preview ↔ source            │
│    C               calendar — move between journals                        esc             in normal mode: leave editor     │
│    O               on this day: week, month, years ago                                                                      │
│    ctrl-p          picker — find any page                                Maintain                                           │
│    F               page tree: folders and namespaces                       R               rebuild index                    │
│    /               search the graph (ripgrep)                              F2              rename page and its links        │
│    b               backlinks + unlinked refs for the current page                                                           │
│    T               todos dashboard (x: done / undo)                      Sidebar                                            │
│    A               agenda: overdue, today, next 7 days                     1               sidebar: page tree               │
│                                                                            2               sidebar: backlinks of this page  │
│  Sync                                                                      3               sidebar: todos                   │
│    S               commit, pull & push the graph (git)                     4               sidebar: agenda                  │
│                                                                            5               sidebar: calendar                │
│  Edit                                                                      |               show / hide the sidebar          │
│    c               capture a line into today's journal (tab: TODO)                                                          │
│    e               edit in-app at the cursor row                         Help / quit                                        │
│    E               edit current page in $EDITOR                            m               mouse on / off (select text)     │
│                                                                            ?               toggle this help                 │
│  Editor                                                                    :               command palette                  │
│    ctrl-s          save; merges outside edits, asks on a clash             esc             close overlay                    │
│    esc             leave editor (prompts if unsaved)                       q               quit                             │
│    ctrl-z / ctrl-y undo / redo                                                                                              │
│    shift-arrows    select (also home/end, pgup/pgdn, words)                                                                 │
│    ctrl-a          select all                                                                                               │
│    ctrl-c / ctrl-x copy / cut (line if nothing selected)                                                                    │
│    ctrl-v          paste the last copy made here                                                                            │
│    alt-← / alt-→   word left / right                                                                                        │
│    home / end      line start / end                                                                                         │
│    pgup / pgdn     page up / down                                                                                           │
│    enter           continue bullet (empty bullet ends it)                                                                   │
│    tab / shift-tab indent / de-indent with children                                                                         │
│    alt-↑ / alt-↓   move bullet with children                                                                                │
│    ctrl-t          cycle marker: open → DONE → plain → TODO                                                                 │
│    alt-s / alt-e   set scheduled / deadline date                                                                            │
│    alt-p           cycle priority A → B → C → none                                                                          │
│    ctrl-r          live preview ↔ source                                                                                    │
│    [[              link completion (↑/↓, enter/tab, esc)                                                                    │
│    #               tag completion after # + letter                                                                          │
│                                                                                                                             │
│  ? or esc to close                                                       weft v1.0.0 · https://github.com/fiatcode-gh/weft  │
╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯